title: "From Signature to State"
abstract: >-
  A developer's guide to blockchains, smart contracts, L2s, security,
  and Rust infrastructure. Fifty-one chapters that follow one signed
  transaction into canonical state, a 274-note reference layer, and
  eight reproducible labs.
